Quick Note: Fixing SonarQube IP in Jenkins After Server RestartWhy it breaks:
When you restart your AWS EC2 server,
it gets a new Public IP.How to fix it:Copy your new Public IP from the AWS EC2 Console. 
Go to Jenkins ➔ Manage Jenkins ➔ System (Configure System)
.Find the SonarQube servers section.Update the Server URL with the new IP (e.g., http://<NEW_IP>:1234).Click Save.
